WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.242
It was early morning in Mountain National Park.

2
00:00:04.243 --> 00:00:08.304
A skunk walked past a sign that read "Old Misty Geyser."

3
00:00:08.305 --> 00:00:12.421
Bloop! Bloop! Water bubbled from the geyser.

4
00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:15.316
A drop splashed onto the skunk.

5
00:00:15.317 --> 00:00:22.106
The skunk hurried into the woods.

6
00:00:22.107 --> 00:00:30.836
Crack! A tree fell over as the skunk began to grow.

7
00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:33.015
*** "Look!" Mara

8
00:00:33.016 --> 00:00:37.093
said. "I see the actor who plays Mighty

9
00:00:37.094 --> 00:00:39.661
Man." Roxy's class was at Mountain National

10
00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:41.658
Park. Lots of people were

11
00:00:41.659 --> 00:00:45.241
there. They stood around Old Misty, the park's

12
00:00:45.242 --> 00:00:50.805
geyser. The actor from Mighty Man was taking a selfie with some

13
00:00:50.806 --> 00:00:54.211
fans. Terrell read a sign near the ranger station.

14
00:00:54.212 --> 00:00:58.523
"The last time Old Misty blew was six years ago."

15
00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:03.948
Roxy looked at the sign. "We were only two years old then."

16
00:01:03.949 --> 00:01:06.627
She turned and saw her reflection in a window.

17
00:01:06.628 --> 00:01:08.752
She felt strange.

18
00:01:08.753 --> 00:01:13.686
"Weird," Roxy thought. "I feel like I've been here before."

19
00:01:13.687 --> 00:01:15.270
Someone bumped into her.

20
00:01:15.271 --> 00:01:18.556
"Oof!" Roxy said.

21
00:01:18.557 --> 00:01:21.938
"Sorry, kid!" A soldier walked by.

22
00:01:21.939 --> 00:01:24.375
A general and some other people followed her.

23
00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:28.717
One person in the group looked familiar.

24
00:01:28.718 --> 00:01:31.354
"That's Dr. Chen," Roxy thought.

25
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:33.882
"I met her on the space station."

26
00:01:33.883 --> 00:01:37.255
The scientist pointed a device at Old Misty.

27
00:01:37.256 --> 00:01:39.358
Roxy wanted to say hello.

28
00:01:39.359 --> 00:01:41.458
But she knew she couldn't do that.

29
00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:45.526
"Dr. Chen only knows Rocket Girl," Roxy thought.

30
00:01:45.527 --> 00:01:49.011
Terrell's phone beeped.

31
00:01:49.012 --> 00:01:51.864
"I got a text from my mom," he said.

32
00:01:51.865 --> 00:01:54.599
"I have a dentist appointment this afternoon.

33
00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.872
I can still come over for dinner though."

34
00:01:56.873 --> 00:01:58.963
"Great," Roxy said.

35
00:01:58.964 --> 00:02:01.176
Roxy was looking forward to the weekend.

36
00:02:01.177 --> 00:02:04.510
"Terrell is coming over for dinner tonight," she thought.

37
00:02:04.511 --> 00:02:08.078
"Tomorrow we're meeting Mara and Jack at Metro City Mall.

38
00:02:08.079 --> 00:02:12.812
Maybe I won't have to do any Rocket Girl stuff. I can just have fun!"

39
00:02:12.813 --> 00:02:16.224
"Roxy, Terrell!" Mara shouted.

40
00:02:16.225 --> 00:02:21.245
"Come over here!" She and Jack were near Old Misty. Roxy

41
00:02:21.246 --> 00:02:23.393
and Terrell ran over. "The

42
00:02:23.394 --> 00:02:27.453
geyser is bubbling a lot!" Jack said. A

43
00:02:27.454 --> 00:02:32.586
park ranger smiled. "This is your lucky day, folks! Old Misty is about to—" Fwoosh!

44
00:02:32.587 --> 00:02:36.112
Water shot up from the geyser. Steam

45
00:02:36.113 --> 00:02:42.914
filled the air. The crowd cheered. ***

46
00:02:42.915 --> 00:02:46.560
Roxy and her friends talked about their weekend plans for a while.

47
00:02:46.561 --> 00:02:49.722
Then she said good-bye and headed home.

48
00:02:49.723 --> 00:02:54.518
She was almost there when her watch beeped.

49
00:02:54.519 --> 00:02:58.756
"Mayor Bloom, what's wrong? Is a villain causing trouble?"

50
00:02:58.757 --> 00:03:01.480
"No, Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

51
00:03:01.481 --> 00:03:03.750
"It's not a villain who's causing trouble.

52
00:03:03.751 --> 00:03:08.929
It's a superhero—Mighty Man!"

